<P align=center><IMG style="BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: " onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201702/2017022208523541.jpg" width=600></P><BR>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">月<SPAN lang=EN-US>19</SPAN>日下午，我校<SPAN lang=EN-US>28</SPAN>位参赛学生在范玲玲、王新璐两位老师的带领下赴北京参加第十三届“希望杯”全国中学作文总决赛。</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US>20</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">日上午，本届“希望杯”全国中学作文总决赛</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">拉开序幕。首席评委孔庆东、顾振彪等名教授现身开幕式。</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>21</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">日上午<SPAN lang=EN-US>8:30</SPAN>至<SPAN lang=EN-US>11:30</SPAN>，现场作文</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">决赛举行。来自全国各省市的优秀学子为助大学梦而奋笔疾书，书写着属于他们的梦想！我校学生经过努力备赛，沉着应考，都在规定的时间内交出了自己满意的答卷。随后试卷被送往高校教授组成的阅卷组，进入紧张的阅卷环节。</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: " class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">活动期间，主办方邀请了多位名师为学生带来了各式精彩的演讲，例如北大著名教授孔庆东和漆永祥，北京<SPAN lang=EN-US>101</SPAN>中学副校长、语文特级教师程翔等，他们讲述着自己的文学理想与文字奇旅，浸润着现场学子的文学之心。</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: " class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋" lang=EN-US>21</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">日晚，“中国好才艺”文艺晚会举行。我校十佳歌手何欣芸同学放声歌唱，一曲《我和我的祖国》赢得阵阵掌声。</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: " class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋" lang=EN-US>22</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">日，我们走出校园，走进北京大学，走进圆明园，走进鸟巢与水立方，去感受北京的摩登、寒冷与那传说中的蓝天。</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋" lang=EN-US>24</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">日上午，本届</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">全国“希望杯”中学作文总决赛</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">颁奖典礼举行。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">中国当代语文教学专业委员会秘书长毛继东教授致辞。随后，大会分别公布了各奖项的具体名单。我校参赛的<SPAN lang=EN-US>28</SPAN>名同学荣获佳绩，其中一等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>17</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">人，二等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>人。我校获得“优秀组织机构奖”荣誉称号。<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋"></SPAN> </P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">我校参赛学生获奖名单：</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">一等奖：李佳宁、俞飞菲、王艺陶、孟琴音、庞亚轩、韩慧瑜、尉宸浩、程诺、张刘灯、罗文颀、娄嘉丽、何欣芸、许珏滢、寿佳涵、赵珂怡、王佳琦、朱雯菲<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">二等奖：傅俊杰、许诺、王昊石、郭羽晨、张雨萌、金铭萱、胡哲昊、倪晗悦、田婧、鲁艺冰、丁晓雯</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt"></SPAN> </P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">据悉，“希望杯”全国中学作文总决赛中获</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">一等奖及以上者，其信息可作为各重点高校高考录取参考。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">本次活动是一场与他人竞逐的比赛，更是一场为自己喝彩的比赛，通过这次活动，历练了学生的自主能力，提高了学生的写作水平，开阔了学生的思考视角，夯实了学生的思维深度，坚定了学生的文学信仰，让他们在追逐文字的奇妙之旅中多一份能力，多一份自信！祝愿他们继续用手中之笔书写少年奋发之意气、悲天悯人之情怀！<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P><BR>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
